        position: "**One of the few Indian private companies that design complete defence electronic systems in-house**, from components to software.",
        money: "Screener shows **net cash of ₹418cr** at March 2026, counting its treasury investments; for June 2026 the call said ₹530cr of cash and investments, the presentation ₹465.9cr. It plans ₹150–200cr or more of capex over two years and in August agreed to buy ST Advanced Composites, a Chennai maker of composite radar structures, for about ₹10cr. Money from an earlier share sale (QIP) is funding development. Operating cash was only ₹129cr over FY24–FY26 against ₹675cr of profit, and bank guarantees given reached ₹678cr. Promoters hold **42.4%**, unchanged since September 2023.",
        watch: ["FY27 order inflow reaching the ₹2,000cr target.", "Su-30 jammer pod flight trials and the BrahMos seeker order.", "Working capital, 365 days in FY26 against a 320–340-day target."],
